   "claims": [
    "Question or Feedback Name (optional) Email (optional) Results: Minimum Final Exam Grade Results: Minimum Final Exam Grade 89.286% This is the minimum grade you need to get on the final exam.",
    "In most cases, the final exam doesn’t account for 100% of your total grade.",
    "For instance, if the final exam has a weight of 30%, this means the final exam score will account for 30% of your final class grade, with the remaining 70% determined by your performance in other areas.",
    "Step Three: Multiply your current course grade by the weight of all components other than the final exam, which should be equal to 100% minus the final exam weight.",
    "For example, let’s say your current grade in a class is 85%, and you have a final exam that accounts for 30% of your overall grade."
